00:02:06,861 --> 00:02:12,500
mean what to remember exactly but for me there was no doubt in my mind I wanted to be a tank officer

10
00:02:12,501 --> 00:02:20,560
and I was a tanker became finally a tanker but Wolfgang Sterner's first taste of combat

11
00:02:20,561 --> 00:02:28,620
came during the panzers most difficult fight in 1943 in the heat of the Russian summer two million

12
