127
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:49,340
German industry was not able to supply the numbers of vehicles and weapons required.

128
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:55,080
And as a result, you can make a very good case that Hitler could not have gone into Poland

129
00:12:55,081 --> 00:12:58,800
or France or even Russia later in 1941

130
00:12:58,801 --> 00:13:03,120
